 "summary": "The canonical surface is minimal and fully characterized: adjoin, extensionCone, toRingCone, preordering and the induced linear orders each carry membership, generator, universal-property or nonneg_iff lemmas, Zorn-only helpers are private, no bodies are exposed, OrderedIntermediateField carries no free data (the field is determined by the cone so @[ext] holds), and no compatibility artifacts or Mathlib duplicates exist on this pin (Ordering/ has only Basic and Defs; IsRealClosed/Basic has no closure construction). exists_realClosure matches the roadmap target verbatim.",
